url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100457","id":2545044089,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Xskp5","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-16T09:26:13Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T09:26:21Z","body":"> We don't want all of those to use caches from `master`, they should use a cache from their own base branch.\r\n\r\nCommenting something I've come across for earlier PRs: It may be useful to use `${{github.event.pull_request.base.sha}}` ([ref](https://docs.github.com/en/webhooks/webhook-events-and-payloads#pull_request)) to (somehow) figure out the target of the pull request, and ping and / or pull from the appropriate cache.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2545044089/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2545557540","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100457#issuecomment-2545557540","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100457","id":2545557540,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XuiAk","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-16T12:53:31Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T12:53:31Z","body":"At a glance this looks promising! Was considering something like it in my testing, will give it a review in the next few days when I find time!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2545557540/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2545889743","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100457#issuecomment-2545889743","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100457","id":2545889743,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XvzHP","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-16T15:12:41Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T15:12:41Z","body":"> Looks good overall, but how does this deal with stable branches like `4.3`, or dev branches like `3.x`?\r\n\r\nIn the short-term, it doesn't. Those branches already have their own Action syntax/names, which don't overlap with this PR's new cache names at all. If anything, they'll behave *better*, as now there's zero risk of falling back to `master` before their PR cache is setup.\r\n\r\nAs for if this gets cherry-picked and/or when 4.4 becomes a stable branch... That's a little trickier. It *might* be possible to exclude `master` as a fallback for PRs not targeting it, but I'd have to look into it further. Regardless, the \"pinging\" of the `master` cache should always occur, because it persisting is important even if unused\r\n\r\n> Commenting something I've come across for earlier PRs: It may be useful to use `${{github.event.pull_request.base.sha}}` ([ref](https://docs.github.com/en/webhooks/webhook-events-and-payloads#pull_request)) to (somehow) figure out the target of the pull request, and ping and / or pull from the appropriate cache.\r\n\r\nIt's extremely important to note that **only** the default branch of a repo can have its cache accessed by other branches. The idea that all caches could be shared across any PR was a HUGE misconception of the earlier implementation; they're deliberately isolated. That's why I removed the last fallback key case, it *never* came into play.\r\n\r\nIf we wanted something that could reference any PR *from* any PR, the only things I can think of are:\r\n1. Recreating the caches on `master` via callback Action.\r\n2. Upload caches as artifacts & detect/download the right one arbitrarily.\r\n\r\nI've not looked into either option thoroughly, nor am I certain if they're even feasible, but it's a start. I'm absolutely gonna pursue them further in other PRs, but they're almost certainly outside the scope of this one.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2545889743/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569632871","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100457#issuecomment-2569632871","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100457","id":2569632871,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZKXxn","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","sub